<title>USA: Happiness Express files Chapter 11.</title>
<headline>Happiness Express files Chapter 11.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Happiness Express Inc said on Thursday after the market closed that on Wednesday it filed a petition requesting relief under Chapter 11 of the Bankruptcy Code in the U.S. Bankruptcy Court for the Southern District of New York.</p>
</text>
